---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<section class="whynow on-dark section-padding" id="why-now">
  <div class="container whynow-inner">
    <div class="whynow-stat animate-in">
      <span class="stat-year stat-tabular">1985</span>
      <span class="stat-caption" data-i18n="home.wn_stat">The last time Ward 6 got a new alderperson</span>
    </div>
    <div class="whynow-copy">
      <span class="section-label animate-in" data-i18n="home.wn_label">Why now</span>
      <h2 class="section-title animate-in" style="--reveal-delay: 0.1s" data-i18n="home.wn_title">Forty-one years is a career, not a term.</h2>
      <p class="animate-in" style="--reveal-delay: 0.15s" data-i18n="home.wn_desc">Ward 6 has had the same alderman since 1985. He was appointed that year and has been re-elected ten times. That is a long record of service. It is also a long time without a fresh look at what this ward needs, and Ward 6 has not had a real choice in a generation. That changes on February 23, 2027, when the primary decides who goes on to the April 6 general election.</p>
      <a href={`${base}/why-now`} class="btn btn-cream animate-in" style="--reveal-delay: 0.2s" data-i18n="home.wn_cta">Why this race matters</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .whynow { background: radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 80% 20%, rgba(96, 0, 176, 0.45), transparent 60%), var(--purple-deep); position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .whynow-inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.3fr; gap: var(--space-3xl); align-items: center; }
  .whynow-stat { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; border-left: 4px solid var(--pink); padding-left: var(--space-xl); }
  .stat-year { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(4.5rem, 12vw, 9rem); line-height: 0.9; color: var(--white); font-weight: 700; }
  .stat-caption { margin-top: var(--space-md); font-size: var(--text-base); color: var(--pink); font-weight: 600; max-width: 260px; }
  .whynow-copy p { margin-bottom: var(--space-lg); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.86); }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .whynow-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--space-2xl); } }
</style>
